    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coincidences?</strong>\u00a0is a linear first\u2011person psychological horror walking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.poster.avif?t=1754526039\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.webm?t=1754526039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.mp4?t=1754526039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live an ordinary life until your landlord suddenly raises the rent. In search of the cheapest housing you rent a suspiciously cheap house on the edge of the forest and take a job as a cashier at the only store nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and talk to the locals it becomes clear that something bad is happening here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest wilderness atmosphere.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the forest setting and an old house: sounds, lighting and surroundings create total immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with NPCs.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you will interact with the locals, giving you a deeper understanding of what is happening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First\u2011person cutscenes.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short first\u2011person cutscenes enhance the character\u2019s perspective and the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No puzzles.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex tasks: just follow the story and complete simple objectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Approximate playtime ~50 minutes (demo 13\u201315 minutes)</u></i></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coincidences?</strong>\u00a0is a linear first\u2011person psychological horror walking simulator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.poster.avif?t=1754526039\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.webm?t=1754526039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848750/extras/74e775b715d67ec7957931bc6f1392c7.mp4?t=1754526039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live an ordinary life until your landlord suddenly raises the rent. In search of the cheapest housing you rent a suspiciously cheap house on the edge of the forest and take a job as a cashier at the only store nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the house and talk to the locals it becomes clear that something bad is happening here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest wilderness atmosphere.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the forest setting and an old house: sounds, lighting and surroundings create total immersion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction with NPCs.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you will interact with the locals, giving you a deeper understanding of what is happening.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First\u2011person cutscenes.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short first\u2011person cutscenes enhance the character\u2019s perspective and the atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No puzzles.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex tasks: just follow the story and complete simple objectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><u>Approximate playtime ~50 minutes (demo 13\u201315 minutes)</u></i></h2>",
    "short_description": "After a sudden rent hike, you move into a suspiciously cheap house deep in the woods. The price is absurdly low and there\u2019s work nearby\u2014it seems like a stroke of luck. But you soon realize something is seriously wrong with the place...",
